  "fluff": {
    "overview": "<p>Word of Blake Militia infantry served as the backbone of Protectorate garrison forces across dozens of conquered worlds, providing the manpower for territorial control that the Militia's BattleMech and armor assets could not sustain alone. Operating infantry-scale gauss rifles that use magnetic acceleration to propel projectiles at extreme velocities, these field gun crews deliver the longest-ranged and hardest-hitting direct fire available to conventional infantry formations.</p>"
